{
  "body_human_readable": "### Cloudy and Cold Conditions in Kyiv\n\nAs of Thursday afternoon in Kyiv, the weather is cloudy and cold with temperatures hovering around 2\u00b0C (36\u00b0F). However, it feels colder, with the \"feels like\" temperature at about -2\u00b0C (28\u00b0F).\n\nThe sky is completely overcast, with 100% cloud cover. There is a slight chance of snow, around 10%. The humidity is high, at approximately 91%.\n\nWinds are coming from the south at about 10 mph, with gusts reaching up to 23 mph. Some areas may also be experiencing fog. Looking ahead, the forecast for the rest of the day and into the night indicates continued cloudy skies with a chance of snow or rain.",
